@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@* For a screen on a wall: nothing round the page at all. Not BareLayout, which centres its
   content for a login box, and not MainLayout, whose sidebar, command palette and undo toast
   are furniture for somebody sitting in front of it. The wall page draws the sidebar itself
   when it is asked to keep it.

   The reconnect notice is not here because it does not need to be: it lives in App.razor,
   outside every layout, so a wall shows it like any other page. *@
@Body

@* A wall is the screen nobody reloads, so it is the one that most needs this. *@
<ThemeSync Surface="ThemeSurface.Wall" @rendermode="InteractiveServer" />

<div id="blazor-error-ui" class="alert alert-danger m-0 rounded-0 position-fixed bottom-0 start-0 end-0" style="display:none; z-index:1080">
    An error has occurred. <a href="" class="alert-link">Reload</a>
    <a class="float-end" href="" data-dismiss>✕</a>
</div>
